# Architecture boundaries (scripts/check-architecture.sh).
# Format: <name>|<paths>|<extended regex>|<message>
# Adjust the paths to the project layout; a missing path is skipped.

env outside config|internal/handler internal/http internal/service internal/domain|os\.Getenv|os\.LookupEnv|Read configuration in internal/config and inject it.
sql driver in handlers|internal/handler internal/http|"database/sql"|"github\.com/jackc/pgx|Go through the repository/store layer.
domain imports transport|internal/domain|"net/http"|The domain layer must not depend on HTTP.
